Main changes relative to the original project:

- Support for both ECharts 5.x and 6.x, and removal of the peer dependency
  version restriction
- Import from `echarts/core` instead of internal deep paths
- An additional ESM bundle for Node.js ESM and SSR
- Fixes for value clamping, empty data, and `shape: 'container'` layout
- TypeScript definitions and package publishing configuration

